	TAD	T4		/ ADD IN UNCHANGED BITS
	DCA	SETUPV		/ SAVE REMAPPED BITS IN THE "REAL" SETUPVALUE
	JMP	LOOP		/ RETURN FROM 'SELECT' ROUTINE


